  <item>
    <title>Caching out on Nginx</title>
    <link>http://2011.drupalcamp.es/node/466</link>
    <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://nginx.org&quot;&gt;Nginx&lt;/a&gt; is a high-performance, modern, secure web server that is taking the web by storm. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this session we address the practical issues of using Nginx with drupal and how to take advantage to the fullest of running Drupal behind Nginx.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We take into consideration also the security benefits and the several strategies that can be employed for mitigating several types of attacks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This session articulates with the planned &lt;a href=&quot;http://groups.drupal.org/node/168489&quot;&gt;drupal performance showdown &lt;/a&gt;. We will discuss how we built our Nginx setup and explain the rationale behind the choices that we made.&lt;/p&gt;
